<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="take me as I am"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Lyn Lapid"/><amll:meta key="album" value="BUZZKILL"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM72500775"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2698687688"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="002haJ0Q3R3zwT"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1797221528"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="442HUOfI6s9S4vjJ5iQIx9"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="255545833"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="kalve7n"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Ian Franzino</songwriter><songwriter>Andrew Haas</songwriter><songwriter>Katelyn Lapid</songwriter><songwriter>DEZA</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="2:20.011"><div begin="11.258" end="2:20.011"><p begin="11.258" end="16.154" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.258" end="11.483">I</span> <span begin="11.483" end="11.639">been</span> <span begin="11.639" end="11.896">looking</span> <span begin="11.896" end="12.084">too</span> <span begin="12.084" end="12.535">hard</span> <span begin="12.535" end="12.787">for</span> <span begin="12.787" end="12.877">a</span> <span begin="12.877" end="13.137">home</span> <span begin="13.137" end="13.305">on</span> <span begin="13.305" end="13.452">the</span> <span begin="13.452" end="13.945">top,</span> <span begin="13.945" end="14.159">on</span> <span begin="14.159" end="14.282">the</span> <span begin="14.282" end="14.486">top</span> <span begin="14.486" end="14.645">of</span> <span begin="14.645" end="14.743">the</span> <span begin="14.743" end="15.344">surface,</span> <span begin="15.376" end="16.154">searchin&apos;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直在追寻一个栖身之所，在表面之上的巅峰，却始终搜寻不止。</span></p><p begin="16.655" end="21.618" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.655" end="17.010">Looking</span> <span begin="17.010" end="17.149">for</span> <span begin="17.149" end="17.525">something</span> <span begin="17.525" end="18.000">deep,</span> <span begin="18.000" end="18.211">thought</span> <span begin="18.211" end="18.370">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="18.370" end="18.520">too</span> <span begin="18.520" end="18.719">hard</span> <span begin="18.719" end="18.915">to</span> <span begin="18.915" end="19.374">reach,</span> <span begin="19.374" end="19.695">never</span> <span begin="19.695" end="19.911">thought</span> <span begin="19.911" end="20.012">I</span> <span begin="20.012" end="20.207">was</span> <span begin="20.207" end="20.746">someone</span> <span begin="20.838" end="21.618">deservin&apos;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望某种深刻的东西，以为它遥不可及，从未觉得自己值得拥有。</span></p><p begin="21.923" end="27.038" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.923" end="22.063">But</span> <span begin="22.063" end="22.236">it</span> <span begin="22.236" end="22.400">was</span> <span begin="22.400" end="22.598">all</span> <span begin="22.598" end="22.772">in</span> <span begin="22.772" end="22.953">my</span> <span begin="22.953" end="23.389">head,</span> <span begin="23.416" end="23.729">heavy</span> <span begin="23.729" end="23.935">weight</span> <span begin="23.935" end="24.058">on</span> <span begin="24.058" end="24.200">my</span> <span begin="24.200" end="24.777">chest</span> <span begin="24.777" end="25.143">only</span> <span begin="25.143" end="25.632">ever</span> <span begin="25.691" end="25.962">left</span> <span begin="25.962" end="26.232">me</span> <span begin="26.302" end="27.038">hurtin&apos;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但这一切都只是我的臆想，胸口的重压，最终只让我伤痕累累。</span></p><p begin="27.485" end="32.407" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.485" end="27.609">Now</span> <span begin="27.609" end="27.759">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="27.759" end="28.120">callin&apos;</span> <span begin="28.120" end="28.279">a</span> <span begin="28.279" end="28.835">truce</span> <span begin="28.835" end="28.990">on</span> <span begin="28.990" end="29.109">the</span> <span begin="29.109" end="29.341">war</span> <span begin="29.341" end="29.450">in</span> <span begin="29.450" end="29.710">my</span> <span begin="29.710" end="30.130">mind</span> <span begin="30.130" end="30.340">&apos;cause</span> <span begin="30.340" end="30.432">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="30.432" end="30.995">finally</span> <span begin="30.995" end="31.626">learnin&apos;</span> <span begin="31.667" end="32.005">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="32.005" end="32.407">not</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今，我向脑海中的纷争宣告休战，因为我终于明白——我无需再改变。</span></p><p begin="32.510" end="35.177" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.510" end="32.876">Rollin&apos;</span> <span begin="32.876" end="33.350">over,</span> <span begin="33.500" end="33.854">under,</span> <span begin="33.854" end="34.475">inside</span> <span begin="34.548" end="35.177">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再让自己翻来覆去、内外挣扎，</span></p><p begin="35.224" end="37.751" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.224" end="35.520">Turnin&apos;</span> <span begin="35.520" end="36.160">myself</span> <span begin="36.235" end="36.421">all</span> <span begin="36.421" end="36.531">the</span> <span begin="36.531" end="36.796">way</span> <span begin="36.868" end="37.751">around</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不再将自己扭曲得面目全非。</span></p><p begin="37.780" end="40.807" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.780" end="38.079">What</span> <span begin="38.079" end="38.270">you</span> <span begin="38.270" end="38.501">see</span> <span begin="38.501" end="38.964">is</span> <span begin="39.052" end="39.487">what</span> <span begin="39.487" end="39.987">you</span> <span begin="39.987" end="40.807">get</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你所见即是我真实的模样，</span></p><p begin="40.822" end="43.085" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.822" end="41.713">So</span> <span begin="41.936" end="42.619">baby,</span> <span begin="42.619" end="42.937">you</span> <span begin="42.937" end="43.085">can</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以亲爱的，你可以</span></p><p begin="43.085" end="51.175" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.085" end="45.571">Take</span> <span begin="45.571" end="45.830">me</span> <span begin="45.854" end="48.365">as</span> <span begin="48.365" end="48.696">I</span> <span begin="48.696" end="51.175">am</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接受这样的我。</span></p><p begin="48.626" end="51.015" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.626" end="48.829">Take</span> <span begin="48.829" end="48.970">it</span> <span begin="48.970" end="49.226">or</span> <span begin="49.226" end="49.490">leave</span> <span begin="49.490" end="49.688">it,</span> <span begin="49.688" end="49.836">you</span> <span begin="49.836" end="50.004">can</span> <span begin="50.004" end="50.205">take</span> <span begin="50.205" end="50.325">it</span> <span begin="50.325" end="50.683">or</span> <span begin="50.683" end="50.823">leave</span> <span begin="50.823" end="51.015">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接受或离开，随你选择。</span></p><p begin="51.030" end="52.687" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.030" end="51.185">You</span> <span begin="51.185" end="51.322">can</span> <span begin="51.322" end="51.694">take</span> <span begin="51.694" end="51.797">it</span> <span begin="51.797" end="52.056">or</span> <span begin="52.056" end="52.226">leave</span> <span begin="52.226" end="52.354">it,</span> <span begin="52.354" end="52.547">you</span> <span begin="52.547" end="52.687">can</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你可以留下，也可以转身离去。</span></p><p begin="52.581" end="1:01.960" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.581" end="52.773">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="52.773" end="53.044">I</span> <span begin="53.044" end="53.408">know</span> <span begin="53.408" end="53.849">I&apos;ma</span> <span begin="53.849" end="56.432">take</span> <span begin="56.432" end="56.778">me</span> <span begin="56.778" end="59.150">as</span> <span begin="59.150" end="59.401">I</span> <span begin="59.443" end="1:01.960">am</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我知道，我会以最本真的样子拥抱自己。</span></p><p begin="59.414" end="1:01.823" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.414" end="59.638">Take</span> <span begin="59.638" end="59.790">it</span> <span begin="59.790" end="1:00.132">or</span> <span begin="1:00.132" end="1:00.315">leave</span> <span begin="1:00.315" end="1:00.436">it,</span> <span begin="1:00.436" end="1:00.615">you</span> <span begin="1:00.615" end="1:00.771">can</span> <span begin="1:00.771" end="1:00.945">take</span> <span begin="1:00.945" end="1:01.134">it</span> <span begin="1:01.134" end="1:01.483">or</span> <span begin="1:01.483" end="1:01.685">leave</span> <span begin="1:01.685" end="1:01.823">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接受或离开，随你选择。</span></p><p begin="1:01.823" end="1:04.506" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.823" end="1:02.001">You</span> <span begin="1:02.001" end="1:02.122">can</span> <span begin="1:02.122" end="1:02.375">take</span> <span begin="1:02.375" end="1:02.522">it</span> <span begin="1:02.522" end="1:02.812">or</span> <span begin="1:02.812" end="1:02.980">leave</span> <span begin="1:02.980" end="1:03.201">it,</span> <span begin="1:03.201" end="1:03.325">you</span> <span begin="1:03.325" end="1:03.463">can</span> <span begin="1:03.463" end="1:03.684">take</span> <span begin="1:03.684" end="1:03.828">it</span> <span begin="1:03.828" end="1:04.137">or</span> <span begin="1:04.137" end="1:04.314">leave</span> <span begin="1:04.314" end="1:04.506">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">接受或离开，随你选择。</span></p><p begin="1:05.187" end="1:10.116" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.187" end="1:05.400">Got</span> <span begin="1:05.400" end="1:05.577">me</span> <span begin="1:05.577" end="1:05.910">under</span> <span begin="1:05.910" end="1:06.976">safekeepin&apos;</span> <span begin="1:06.976" end="1:07.358">for</span> <span begin="1:07.358" end="1:07.688">those</span> <span begin="1:07.688" end="1:07.880">who</span> <span begin="1:07.880" end="1:08.091">can</span> <span begin="1:08.091" end="1:08.407">grow</span> <span begin="1:08.407" end="1:08.626">to</span> <span begin="1:08.648" end="1:09.063">love</span> <span begin="1:09.063" end="1:09.218">all</span> <span begin="1:09.218" end="1:09.297">of</span> <span begin="1:09.297" end="1:09.448">my</span> <span begin="1:09.448" end="1:10.116">pieces</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将自己珍藏，只为那些能慢慢爱上我所有碎片的人。</span></p><p begin="1:10.159" end="1:14.859" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.159" end="1:10.433">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:10.433" end="1:10.561">not</span> <span begin="1:10.561" end="1:10.851">gonna</span> <span begin="1:10.851" end="1:11.236">settle</span> <span begin="1:11.236" end="1:11.451">to</span> <span begin="1:11.451" end="1:11.597">be</span> <span begin="1:11.597" end="1:12.604">tolerated</span> <span begin="1:12.604" end="1:12.776">or</span> <span begin="1:12.776" end="1:13.126">put</span> <span begin="1:13.126" end="1:13.283">on</span> <span begin="1:13.283" end="1:13.394">a</span> <span begin="1:13.394" end="1:13.842">shelf</span> <span begin="1:13.842" end="1:13.955">for</span> <span begin="1:13.955" end="1:14.859">decoration</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不愿妥协，只为了被容忍，或成为装饰品被人搁置一旁。</span></p><p begin="1:15.064" end="1:20.742" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.064" end="1:15.282">And</span> <span begin="1:15.282" end="1:15.442">I</span> <span begin="1:15.451" end="1:15.797">know</span> <span begin="1:15.822" end="1:16.000">that</span> <span begin="1:16.000" end="1:16.126">it</span> <span begin="1:16.189" end="1:16.519">means</span> <span begin="1:16.542" end="1:16.682">that</span> <span begin="1:16.682" end="1:16.800">my</span> <span begin="1:16.800" end="1:17.269">circle</span> <span begin="1:17.322" end="1:17.463">gets</span> <span begin="1:17.509" end="1:18.002">smaller,</span> <span begin="1:18.002" end="1:18.270">but</span> <span begin="1:18.270" end="1:18.529">it</span> <span begin="1:18.529" end="1:18.897">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:18.897" end="1:19.240">mean</span> <span begin="1:19.240" end="1:19.375">I</span> <span begin="1:19.375" end="1:19.580">have</span> <span begin="1:19.580" end="1:19.906">less</span> <span begin="1:19.906" end="1:20.056">left</span> <span begin="1:20.056" end="1:20.192">to</span> <span begin="1:20.227" end="1:20.742">offer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明白这意味着我的圈子会变得更小，但这并不代表我拥有的价值有所减少。</span></p><p begin="1:20.691" end="1:23.552" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.691" end="1:20.901">And</span> <span begin="1:20.901" end="1:21.287">those</span> <span begin="1:21.287" end="1:21.390">that</span> <span begin="1:21.398" end="1:21.565">are</span> <span begin="1:21.574" end="1:21.859">right</span> <span begin="1:21.866" end="1:22.045">will</span> <span begin="1:22.045" end="1:22.252">just</span> <span begin="1:22.252" end="1:22.515">stick</span> <span begin="1:22.555" end="1:22.923">around</span> <span begin="1:22.923" end="1:23.552">longer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真正适合的人，会停留得更久。</span></p><p begin="1:24.275" end="1:26.355" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.275" end="1:24.500">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="1:24.500" end="1:24.705">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:24.705" end="1:24.939">no</span> <span begin="1:24.939" end="1: